# Commit

Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) — see `.claude/skills/commit/SKILL.md`.

## CHANGELOG

**Do not** edit `CHANGELOG.md` manually. [release-please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please) updates it when opening the Release PR, from conventional commits since the last release.

Write clear `feat:` / `fix:` / `perf:` commit messages so release notes are accurate. See [docs/release.md](docs/release.md).
